# Day 34 - Spring AI Chat Memory 🧠

Today I learned how to add conversation memory to a Spring AI application.

## What I learned

- ChatClient
- ChatMemory
- MessageWindowChatMemory
- MessageChatMemoryAdvisor
- Conversation ID
- Multi-turn conversations
- Maintaining context between requests

## How it works

The application stores previous messages in ChatMemory and uses a conversation ID to identify the conversation.

```text
User
 ↓
ChatController
 ↓
ChatService
 ↓
ChatClient
 ↓
MessageChatMemoryAdvisor
 ↓
ChatMemory
 ↓
Groq
